./ R 00830000          $ 00830000 010                                           
VMESA390 EQU   X'02'          VMFSTAT: ESA/390 MACHINE         XA0054DK         
         TM    VMFSTAT,VMESA390  I-288: AN ESA/390 GUEST RUNS  XA0054DK         
         BO    *+8            ON, DISCONNECTED                 XA0054DK         
         OI    VMRSTAT,VMCFWAIT    DO NOT RUN THIS MACHINE     XA0054DK         
./ R 00892000          $ 00892000 010                                           
DSCNMSG  EQU   *              DISCONNECT WITH NO OPERATOR MSG  XA0054DK         
         TM    VMFSTAT,VMESA390  I-288: NO 15-MINUTE LOGOFF    XA0054DK         
         BO    DSCEXIT        FOR AN ESA/390 GUEST             XA0054DK         
